    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "key": "b2",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "E211 Sodium benzoate is a synthetic salt of benzoic acid used as a preservative to inhibit mould, yeast and bacteria, mainly in acidic foods and drinks."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "key": "b3",
